{"slug":"Leetcode-100-Same-Tree","title":"Leetcode#100. Same Tree","date":"2023-07-25","updated":"","tags":["Leetcode","Python","medium","Tree","Depth-First Search","Breadth-First Search","Binary Tree"],"categories":["Leetcode"],"cover":"/img/cover/leetcode.jpg","excerpt":"Given the roots of two binary trees and , write a function to check if they are the same or not. Two binary trees are considered the same if they are structurally identical, and the nodes have the sam","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<h1 id=\"problem\"><a href=\"#problem\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Problem</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<p>Given the roots of two binary trees <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>p</span></span></code></span> and <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>q</span></span></code></span>, write a function to check if they are the same or not.</p>\n<p>Two binary trees are considered the same if they are structurally identical, and the nodes have the same value.</p>\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2020/12/20/ex1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2020/12/20/ex1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: p = [1,2,3], q = [1,2,3]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: true</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2020/12/20/ex2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2020/12/20/ex2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: p = [1,2], q = [1,null,2]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: false</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 3:</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2020/12/20/ex3.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2020/12/20/ex3.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: p = [1,2,1], q = [1,1,2]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: false</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The number of nodes in both trees is in the range <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>[0, 100]</span></span></code></span>.</li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>10^4 &#x3C;= Node.val &#x3C;= 10^4</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"solve\"><a href=\"#solve\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Solve</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> isSameTree</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">p</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: Optional[TreeNode], </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">q</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: Optional[TreeNode]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">and</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> q:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> True</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        elif</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">or</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> q </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">or</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> p.val </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> q.val:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> False</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">isSameTree</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(p.left,q.left) </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">and</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">isSameTree</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(p.right,q.right))</span></span></code></pre></figure>"}